    <p>Adrián Hernández is a music producer and sound designer based in Madrid.</p>
    <p>Operating at the intersection of computer music, internet culture, and sonic storytelling, his work spans from electronic avant-garde production under his alias Joven Promesa Main Serenata, to contemporary soundscapes for visual media and commercial production.</p>
    <p>Whether through avant-garde club textures or vulnerable songwriting, his practice is defined by a distinctly contemporary, digital edge.</p>
